      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the info. the purplish tint makes sense because i've definitely seen that on the older blades. if i decide to get some fertilizer, do you have any recommendations on what ratio i should look for for a residential lawn? i dont want to overdo it and mess anything up.",
